---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Seller Order KH Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Seller Order KH."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span>
      <h1>Seller Order KH Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Privacy information for Seller Order KH.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>Last updated: September 5, 2026</strong></p>

      <h2>1. Scope</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy applies to Seller Order KH, a Kroma Digital
        application designed to help sellers manage orders, customers,
        delivery addresses, payment status, and related business records.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information entered into the app</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH allows users to enter and manage information such as
        customer names, phone numbers, delivery addresses, product details,
        order amounts, payment status, order source, delivery notes, and other
        order-related notes.
      </p>
      <p>
        This information is entered by the user for the purpose of managing
        their own business records.
      </p>

      <h2>3. How data is stored and processed</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH stores its primary order, customer, address, and
        related business data locally on the user's device.
      </p>
      <p>
        Kroma Digital does not operate a server that receives or stores the
        customer and order records entered into Seller Order KH.
      </p>
      <p>
        The app does not require users to create an account or sign in to a
        Kroma Digital account.
      </p>

      <h2>4. CSV export, backup, and restore</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH may allow users to export order data as a CSV file and
        create backup files containing app data.
      </p>
      <p>
        Users choose where exported or backup files are saved using Android's
        file selection interface. Restore functionality allows users to select
        a previously created backup file and restore its contents into the app.
      </p>
      <p>
        Kroma Digital does not automatically upload these export or backup
        files to a Kroma Digital server.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Analytics inside the app</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH may provide business analytics such as order totals,
        sales summaries, order-status breakdowns, and order-source summaries.
      </p>
      <p>
        These analytics are calculated from the data stored locally in the app.
        Seller Order KH does not currently use an external analytics SDK to
        send these business records to Kroma Digital.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Google Play Billing and Pro features</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH may offer optional Pro features through Google Play
        Billing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Purchases are processed by Google Play. Kroma Digital does not receive
        or store users' full payment card or banking details.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google may process information related to purchases according to
        Google's own terms and privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH uses only permissions and platform services necessary
        for its implemented features.
      </p>
      <p>
        File creation and file selection for CSV export, backup, and restore
        are handled through Android's system file picker where applicable.
      </p>
      <p>
        The app uses Google Play Billing functionality for optional in-app
        purchases.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH currently uses Google Play services related to app
        distribution and Google Play Billing.
      </p>
      <p>
        The app does not currently include third-party advertising,
        third-party behavioral analytics, or a Kroma Digital cloud storage
        service for customer and order records.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Data retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>
        Order, customer, address, and related business records remain stored
        locally until they are edited or deleted by the user, removed through
        app functionality, or removed when application data is cleared or the
        application is uninstalled, subject to the behavior of the user's
        Android device and any backups controlled by the user.
      </p>
      <p>
        Exported CSV files and backup files are controlled by the user and must
        be deleted by the user from the location where they were saved.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Data security</h2>
      <p>
        Kroma Digital takes reasonable steps to design Seller Order KH so that
        business records remain under the user's control. However, no device,
        storage system, or software can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>
      <p>
        Users are responsible for protecting access to their device and any
        exported or backup files they create.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Seller Order KH is intended as a business utility for sellers and is
        not designed specifically for children.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Kroma Digital may update this Privacy Policy when Seller Order KH is
        changed or when its data-handling practices change. The latest version
        will be published on this page.
      </p>

      <h2>13. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or Seller Order KH,
        please contact Kroma Digital at
        <a href="mailto:kromadigital.apps@gmail.com">
          kromadigital.apps@gmail.com
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can also visit the Kroma Digital
        <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
